  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-11T11:05:40.698Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If the distance between the Object that can be Pickup and the Object that can be Interacted with in the world (e.g. Mirror's Switch, Object's Spawn Switch, etc.) is close, the PickupObject will be selected even if you try to select the Switch in front of it.\nCan you please restore the range of possible pickups?\n\nワールド内にPickup可能なObjectとInteract可能なObject（例：ミラーのSwitch、ObjectのSpawn Switchなど）の距離が近いと、目の前にあるSwitchを選択しようとしてもPickupObjectが選択されてしまいます。\nPickup可能な範囲を元に戻していただけないでしょうか。",
